      "title": "From the first roar to the final tap.",
      "text": "Football is emotional. Buying a ticket should feel effortless. This direction pairs stadium-scale imagery and condensed typography with a simple, deliberate booking flow."
    },
    {
      "id": "afc-chapter-01",
