      "layout": "chapter",
      "chapter": "01 / THE LANDING",
      "title": "One stage. One clear invitation.",
      "text": "A cinematic opening draws the fan in. Team filters bring the right matches forward, while the ticket action stays visible and easy to understand. Try the filters and ticket previews below."
